OL,3,ATrump announces deal for Russian diesel
OL,4,Aas Zelensky calls it a gift to Putin
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Donald Trump has announced a
OL,7,Fdeal to import Russian diesel into the
OL,8,FUS, as he faces mounting pressure to
OL,9,Fbring down fuel prices.
OL,11,FTrump said Putin had agreed to release
OL,12,F300,000 tonnes of diesel immediately
OL,13,F"to the American and global
OL,14,Fmarketplace" followed by 500,000 tonnes
OL,15,Fin November and another million after
OL,16,Fthat.
OL,18,FThe move on Friday sparked anger from
OL,19,FUkraine's President Volodymr Zelensky,
OL,20,Fwho called it a gift to Putin that
OL,21,Famounts to "an investment in a war that
OL,22,Fmust be ended, not prolonged".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
